-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §41 גמול למורה המלמד בכיתות המאוכלסות
-- בתלמידים מחוננים: a teacher of a class of gifted pupils, as the Ministry
-- defines one, is owed 14% of the combined salary by the share of his
-- position in it (frontal hours there over all his frontal hours); the State
-- works for its recognition in the pension, and contributions are made on
-- it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `41 גמול למורה המלמד בכיתות המאוכלסות בתלמידים מחוננים`

`the gifted-classes rate` MEANS 14%

-- (א): the position for this allowance is the share of the teacher's
-- frontal hours taught in such classes; the reading adopted, as in §39(ג):
-- that share of the position held. No rounding is stated (convention
-- rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_41__para_a
GIVEN `full-position combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
      `frontal hours` IS A NUMBER
      `frontal hours in gifted classes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the gifted-classes allowance` `full-position combined salary` `position fraction` `frontal hours` `frontal hours in gifted classes` IS
    IF `frontal hours` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN `the gifted-classes rate` TIMES `full-position combined salary` TIMES `position fraction`
         TIMES (`frontal hours in gifted classes` DIVIDED BY `frontal hours`)
    ELSE 0

DECLARE `section 41 action` IS ONE OF
    `act to have the allowance recognised as permanent for the pension law`
    `make accrual-pension contributions on the allowance`
    `make study-fund contributions on the allowance`

-- (ב): the State acts for its recognition under the pensions law; for one
-- in an accrual pension, contributions are made on it.
@ref akn:art_41__para_b
GIVEN `insured in an accrual pension` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 41 action`
DECIDE `the pension on the gifted-classes allowance` `insured in an accrual pension` IS
    IF `insured in an accrual pension`
    THEN PARTY `the State` MUST `make accrual-pension contributions on the allowance`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 41(ב): accrual-pension contributions on the allowance"
    ELSE PARTY `the State` MUST `act to have the allowance recognised as permanent for the pension law`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 41(ב): the State acts for the allowance's recognition"

-- (ג): study-fund contributions on it.
@ref akn:art_41__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 41 action`
DECIDE `the study fund on the gifted-classes allowance` IS
    PARTY `the State` MUST `make study-fund contributions on the allowance`
    LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 41(ג): study-fund contributions on the allowance"

-- A full-time teacher with 13 of 26 frontal hours in gifted classes, on a
-- placeholder 8,000: 14% × 8,000 × 1/2 = 560.
#ASSERT `the gifted-classes allowance` 8000 1 26 13 EQUALS 560
#ASSERT `the gifted-classes allowance` 8000 0.5 13 13 EQUALS 560
